      "Bring iron and fuel. Then a grindstone, so we can finish the work instead of admiring hot metal."
    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.heat_stock.dialogue.offer.response.accept.label": "I will bring the forge stock.",
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.heat_stock.dialogue.offer.response.decline.label": "Another time.",
